{"id":"n52137-1-7","stage":4,"title":"말문 · (就说话而言的)口","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52137-1-7-1","ko":"유민 씨는 말이 별로 없더라.","zh":"裕敏话不太多的样子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏","readings":[{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨는","audio":"/audio/1e98662e92cdd5672d9e.mp3"}},{"text":"말이","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이","audio":"/audio/250054307dc16bb3bc3e.mp3"}},{"text":"별로","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}},{"text":"없더라.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없더라","audio":"/audio/3b613d367e750876c8d5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"特别，格外","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"特殊额外地；或指那么不同地。","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c7536bb970afd2d32ca7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52137-1-7-2","ko":"처음에는 그렇지만 친해지면 곧 말문이 터질 거야.","zh":"一开始是这样，但熟了之后很快就会变得话多起来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"처음에는","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음에는","audio":"/audio/742209b37bb9c9037070.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇지만","meaning":"即便是那样，但是","explanation":"그렇지만：即便是那样，但是","readings":[{"term":"그렇지만","audio":"/audio/47d15ebbdcc7c92499f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70718","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇지만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇지만","audio":"/audio/47d15ebbdcc7c92499f0.mp3"}},{"text":"친해지면","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친해지면","audio":"/audio/3f5790de4d3e36eb02dd.mp3"}},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}},{"text":"말문이","meaning":"(就说话而言的)口，腔","explanation":"말문：(就说话而言的)口，腔；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"말문","audio":"/audio/0f242cea85f5fa77de88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52137","senseId":"1","lemma":"말문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말문이","audio":"/audio/5c8fc32fa81e2825de3c.mp3"}},{"text":"터질","meaning":"放声，爆出","explanation":"터지다：放声，爆出；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"터지다","audio":"/audio/463197edfeab332fb5d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91125","senseId":"9","lemma":"터지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"터질","audio":"/audio/9dab327405b6abdec2d8.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"47d15ebbdcc7c924","term":"그렇지만","zh":"即便是那样，但是","audio":"/audio/47d15ebbdcc7c92499f0.mp3","entryId":"70718","definition":"表示与前面所说内容相对立的内容，尽管前面所说的是事实。","pronunciation":["그러치만"]},{"id":"0275722d7b511a47","term":"친하다","zh":"亲近，要好，亲密","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3","entryId":"80614","definition":"近交相知，感情深厚。","pronunciation":["친하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"0f242cea85f5fa77","term":"말문","zh":"(就说话而言的)口，腔","audio":"/audio/0f242cea85f5fa77de88.mp3","entryId":"52137","definition":"为了说话而张开的嘴。","pronunciation":["말ː문"]},{"id":"463197edfeab332f","term":"터지다","zh":"放声，爆出","audio":"/audio/463197edfeab332fb5d4.mp3","entryId":"91125","definition":"突然一下子响起掌声、笑声、哭声、声音等。","pronunciation":["터ː지다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/fca4560f061f3efb20ba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.845,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=52137","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["一开始是这样，但熟了之后很快就会变得话多起来的。","裕敏话不太多的样子。","这个很好吃，试试看怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏话不太多的样子。","这个很好吃，试试看怎么样？","一开始是这样，但熟了之后很快就会变得话多起来的。"],"answer":2}]}
